cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SpectralFinder, please cite it as below, together with HITRAN and HAPI (see references)."
title: SpectralFinder
abstract: >-
  Finds the spectral windows where several gases (and isotopologues) can be measured
  simultaneously in a single laser scan, from HITRAN line-by-line data computed with HAPI:
  absorption at the instrument's path length, pressure and temperature, separation of the
  lines, interference from background gases, and temperature sensitivity.
type: software
